{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.47:1.1"], "en": "\"Homage to you, O Buddha! May there be success for the Hero;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.47:1.2"], "en": "you are utterly liberated in every respect.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.47:1.3"], "en": "“Dwelling in the Tuhyāpāda Cave,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.47:1.4"], "en": "I dwell free from taints.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
